        "body": "Replacement for #111102 (force-push branch recreation closed the original).\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nA hostname parsed as `127.evil.com` satisfies the old `startsWith(\"127.\")` branch, while Node's `isIP()` correctly classifies it as non-literal.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nReplace the standalone proof script with focused `config.test.ts` coverage that exercises the production `isIP()` guard through `resolveCodexAppServerRuntimeOptions`, verifying `ws://127.0.0.1` (literal loopback accepted), `ws://127.evil.com` (DNS hostname rejected), and `ws://localhost` (accepted).\n\n## Changes\n\n- **`extensions/codex/src/app-server/config.test.ts`** — add isIP guard regression tests\n\n## Related\n\nSupersedes #111102\nCloses #111102\n\n## AI Assistance Disclosure\n\nImplemented with AI assistance (Claude Code). I reviewed and understand every changed line.",
